      "content": "u ok?? that sounds scary. but i really dont want to go to the er if i can help it, it's so expensive and i can barely drive right now. it's kinda fading a little bit now, it's still bad but it's not that sharp anymore. do u think it's possible it's just a massive tension headache or maybe just dehydration? can i just take some extra advil and sleep it off?",
